        <mxCell id="p396i" value="BLOQUEANTES (15 threads)&lt;br&gt;• TOML: quoted keys "mcp_servers"=[] y headers ["mcp_servers".env]&lt;br&gt;• Ownership: hooks concord-* exactos + isConcordOwned(p) p/ mcp_servers&lt;br&gt;• Global mode: instructionFile('vibe', $VIBE_HOME/AGENTS.md) + docs&lt;br&gt;• Workspace: pin CONCORD_REPO_ROOT desde payload cwd (hooks + inbox drain/observe)&lt;br&gt;• Read receipts: unir chunks en orden conversación + fixture 2 chunks&lt;br&gt;• CHANGELOG [Unreleased] · borrar docs/diagrams/issue-352-353-analysis.drawio" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
